{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A not-quite-turn-based battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate strategic options while avoiding real-time attacks in a system inspired by Paper Mario and Undertale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equippable abilities for your character and your magic pencil</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Skills, swap them out anytime, and try different combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An expressive moveset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up speed, then twirl, dive, and flip to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control nearby objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your pencil to switch up the gameplay when you get tired of guiding this bozo around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An involved story that spans multiple chapters! Stop the planet-destroying Lord Doomon, learn more about him, and uncover the secrets that lurk at the heart of the galaxy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new planet to explore in each chapter. Mythical islands, futuristic cities, and more await!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun characters to follow you around, help you fight, and let you use cool abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available, and will expand to include all of Chapter 1 in 2026. The full game is planned to release sometime this decade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Steam Achievements don't currently work on Mac. I'm still figuring out why, so apologies in the meantime.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133460?t=1765845532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/febc0994a21e3a6a5a5cbd8200d3ff1582a367dd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765845532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/22decaa18b5ccec354445ba7f3394fb006818b29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765845532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/22decaa18b5ccec354445ba7f3394fb006818b29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765845532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4133470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A not-quite-turn-based battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate strategic options while avoiding real-time attacks in a system inspired by Paper Mario and Undertale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_