_paragraph\" >Throw your pencil to switch up the gameplay when you get tired of guiding this bozo around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An involved story that spans multiple chapters! Stop the planet-destroying Lord Doomon, learn more about him, and uncover the secrets that lurk at the heart of the galaxy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new planet to explore in each chapter. Mythical islands, futuristic cities, and more await!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun characters to follow you around, help you fight, and let you use cool abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available, and will expand to include all of Chapter 1 in 2026. The full game is planned to release sometime this decade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Steam Achievements don't currently work on Mac. I'm still figuring out why, so apologies in the meantime.)</p>","developers":["CoolGuyBug Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/fa99781b1822a0c967f0de8923c8c0b7dd00ad63/header.jpg?t=1765845532","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Jud